## Gannet Brand Assets

The files in this directory are the Gannet mark and icon set, owned by
**unsubstantiation** (fairuniversal.com), the individual who maintains this fork.
They are brand material and are **not** part of the software license. Software
licenses license code; names and logos are governed by trademark law, and
trademark rights do not transfer just because code does.

### You may

- display these assets to identify this fork and its documentation, and
- keep them in place in an unmodified copy that you are evaluating.

### You may not

- use these assets in a way that suggests affiliation with, sponsorship by, or
  endorsement from this fork or its author, or
- present these assets as your own, or register them (or anything confusingly
  similar) as a trademark, service mark, or other source indicator, or
- include these assets in your own version of this software.

### If you fork or otherwise modify this software, replace these assets

If you distribute a version of this software that you modified, you must use your
own name, logo, and visual identity — including for the icons and other files in
this directory — and must remove ours entirely. That rule is not a restriction we
impose on you for our benefit; it is the boundary that keeps us from asserting
rights over your project and keeps you from asserting ours. Modifying the colors,
proportions, or other details of our assets is not enough: create original assets
or use assets you have the right to distribute. You may still state accurately
that your version derives from this one, in plain text, without our assets.

### Upstream note

The upstream project (Frigate) has its own brand terms — see
[TRADEMARK.md](../../../TRADEMARK.md) at the repository root. **Frigate's name, logo, and
icon set are not covered by this fork's permission to reuse anything in this
directory.** This fork has removed Frigate's logo, wordmark, and icon assets from
the documentation site and the shipped UI; if you find one still present, that is a
defect to report, not a licence to use it.
